From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: herdr maintainers <maintainers@herdr.dev>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] control ConPTY loading

Load Herdr's hash-verified app-local ConPTY with a constrained DLL search,
otherwise use the exports from the already loaded kernel32 module. Never
probe for a bare conpty.dll through the DLL search path.

Herdr issues: https://github.com/ogulcancelik/herdr/issues/761
              https://github.com/ogulcancelik/herdr/issues/1533
Vendored base: portable-pty 0.9.0
---
